A procedure with more than 80 code lines (ssl.diagnostics.maxProcedureCodeLines,
default 80) reports diag.procedure_length_review, info tier, over the
:PROCEDURE keyword and name. Blank and comment lines do not count: this
one has 82 code lines (issue #344).
